  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of an older man with glasses and a mustache, adjusting his glasses while wearing a large ring. The text overlay reads 'keep it up and you'll get some regime change.' This meme uses the visual of a seemingly authoritative or serious figure to imply that persistent activism or protest will lead to political change. The intent is propagandistic, aiming to motivate or encourage continued political engagement by suggesting a tangible, desirable outcome (regime change) is achievable through sustained effort. The image does not contain any elements of toxicity such as racism, antisemitism, misogyny, ableism, or LGBTQ+ discrimination. The focus is on political messaging rather than attacking individuals or groups based on protected characteristics. The overall intent is to influence opinion or action toward a specific political goal — encouraging support for or participation in movements seeking political change.",
